00:24:11.960 --> 00:24:15.180
Now, as all recognize, it's becoming superior to yours.

00:24:15.440 --> 00:24:20.680
Soon it will be 2 to 1, then 3 to 1, finally it will be 5 to 1.

00:24:21.200 --> 00:24:26.160
With such a nuclear superiority it will be possible to block the use of your weapons.

00:24:26.160 --> 00:24:29.600
And on some unlucky morning, they will declare...

00:24:31.020 --> 00:24:42.870
Attention, we are marching our troops to Europe, and if you make a move, we will annihilate you, and this ratio of 3 to 1 or 5 to 1 will have its effect.

00:24:43.150 --> 00:24:59.180
You will not make a move. A concentration of world evil, of hatred for humanity is taking place, and it is fully determined to destroy your society.

00:25:01.140 --> 00:25:04.780
Must you wait until it comes with a crowbar to break through your borders?

00:25:05.580 --> 00:25:09.960
Until the young men of America have to fall defending the borders of their continent?

00:25:10.640 --> 00:25:14.800
The Secretary of the Navy in 1976, J. William Middendorf II.

00:25:15.560 --> 00:25:22.320
Today we face a Soviet threat far greater than any other threat this nation has ever faced in its 200 years of existence.

00:25:22.790 --> 00:25:29.980
Which one of us will want to say to his child or grandchildren when we have...

00:25:30.000 --> 00:25:35.870
the opportunity to protect their freedoms and to rebuild their strength. We didn't do it.

00:25:36.600 --> 00:25:43.120
That lonely voice of Solzhenitsyn is right when he says, we must reassert our will to protect

00:25:43.120 --> 00:25:51.310
their freedoms. In the few precious moments of freedom that we may have left, let's not be found

00:25:51.310 --> 00:25:59.310
wanting. Only through such strength can we be certain of deterring a nuclear attack or an

00:25:59.310 --> 00:25:59.970
overwhelming...

00:26:00.000 --> 00:26:09.770
ground attack on our forces and our allies. Only through such strength can we in the free world,

00:26:10.900 --> 00:26:19.000
should that deterrent fail, face the tragedy of another war with any hope of survival. And that

00:26:19.000 --> 00:26:26.850
deterrent strength, if it is to be effective and credible, when compared with that of any other

00:26:26.850 --> 00:26:29.860
nation, must embody the most modern.

00:26:30.540 --> 00:26:37.330
the most reliable and the most versatile nuclear weapons our research and development can produce.

00:26:38.130 --> 00:26:42.030
And until the world can develop a reliable system of international security,

00:26:42.860 --> 00:26:46.940
the free people have no choice but to keep their arms near.

00:26:47.420 --> 00:26:52.440
President Kennedy demonstrated that the price of peace and freedom is military superiority

00:26:52.440 --> 00:26:54.820
and the will to use it if necessary.

00:26:55.060 --> 00:26:59.160
This country, therefore, continues to require the best defense in the world.

00:27:00.000 --> 00:27:05.020
Do you believe that America should rise to this ultimate Soviet challenge and regain

00:27:05.020 --> 00:27:07.420
its military superiority or not?

00:27:08.420 --> 00:27:13.620
Write PeacePoll, Boston, Virginia, 22713.

00:27:14.260 --> 00:27:19.250
We'll let the President and the Congress know how you stand, and we'll send you a free report

00:27:19.370 --> 00:27:25.330
in which top experts propose a new U.S. strategy for peace and freedom.

00:27:26.310 --> 00:27:29.980
The cost of freedom is always high, but Americans...

00:27:30.000 --> 00:27:35.950
have always paid it, and one path we shall never choose, and that is the path of surrender

00:27:35.950 --> 00:27:37.310
or submission.
